OL,3,AUS and Iran trade strikes for first
OL,4,Atime in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran said it had struck US military
OL,7,Fbases in Jordan in response. Jordan's
OL,8,Farmy said it had intercepted eight
OL,9,Fmissiles early on Monday morning.
OL,10,FSeparately, Iran's state TV said the
OL,11,FIranian army had targeted an air base
OL,12,Fin the UAE with drones.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
