OL,3,AIceland votes against restarting EU
OL,4,Amembership talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIceland has voted against resuming
OL,7,Ftalks on joining the European Union 13
OL,8,Fyears after they were broken off.
OL,10,FPublic broadcaster RUV reported that
OL,11,F52.8% of the more than 225,000 people
OL,12,Fwho voted had rejected the government's
OL,13,Fproposal, while 47.2% had backed it.
OL,14,FSome 12,600 votes separated them.
OL,16,FPrime Minister Kristrun Frostadottir's
OL,17,Fcentre-left government promised to hold
OL,18,Fa referendum by 2027, but brought it
OL,19,Fforward because of international
OL,20,Ftensions, including US President Donald
OL,21,FTrump's threats against Greenland.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
